// The app's details, which Ziggy's build reads: its name, which names its log files, its title, which heads them, and its version,
// which they give. "dev" for a local build; the release workflow's scripts/set-build-config.sh writes the release's version here.
.{
    .name = "photosphere",
    .title = "Photosphere",
    .version = "dev",
}
